      "2774"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Acoustic devices show mixed effectiveness.",
    "citations": []
  },
  {
    "statement": "At aquaculture systems, some studies found that acoustic devices reduced predation on caged salmon by grey seals, harbour seals and South American sea lions.",
