      "2815"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Switching off artificial lighting at wild fisheries was tested in one study in the Puntledge River.",
    "citations": [
      "2825"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Switching off artificial lighting did not deter harbour seals from feeding on salmon released from a hatchery in one study.",
