  },
  {
    "statement": "Acoustic devices at aquaculture systems showed mixed effectiveness across several studies.",
    "citations": [
      "2775"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Four studies found that acoustic devices reduced predation on caged salmon by grey seals, harbour seals and South American sea lions.",
